target/
artifacts/
coverage/
# Repo-relative fallback for the off-tree live campaign corpus (fuzz.sh).
.scratch-corpus/
# corpus/ IS tracked — the committed cases are the CI regression set (replayed
# by tests/corpus_replay.rs). It does NOT collect campaign noise: `fuzz.sh run`
# writes the live corpus off-tree (under CARGO_TARGET_DIR, or $EEZ_FUZZ_SCRATCH,
# else .scratch-corpus/); `fuzz.sh promote` folds new finds in (minimized) so
# you `git add` + commit to EXTEND it deliberately.
# The root workspace Cargo.lock is authoritative (this is a workspace member).
Cargo.lock
